  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ariphokala anatuluka kula Nyumba ya Kuvoya Mlungu, mwanafundziwe mmwenga wamuamba, “Mwalimu, lola vira higa mawe garivyo manono na dzengo ririvyo nono ra ajabu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye achimuamba, “Dze, unagaona gara madzengo makulu? Taphana hata dziwe mwenga ndirosala dzulu ya ranjina, chila chitu chindabomolwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badaye aphiya Mwango wa Mizaituni, ambao unalolana na Nyumba ya Kuvoya Mlungu. Wakati Jesu kala asegere hiko, Petero, Jakobo, Johana na Anderea amlunga achikala naye machiyao, achimuuza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Huambire mambo higo gandakala rini? Ni dalili yani ndiyoonyesa kukala mambo higa gosi ga phephi gahendeka?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Jesu achiaambira, “Dzimanyirireni sedze mkachengbwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana kundakpwedza anji ahumire dzina rangu, nao andachenga atu anji, na kuamba, ‘Mimi ndiye iye Masihi!’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yani",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Masihi",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ". (Misitari 21 na 22.)",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mchisikira habari za viha na ndziyendziye za viha, msitishirwe. Mana mambo higa ni lazima gakale, ela mwisho wa dunia undakala taudzangbwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsi mwenga indapigana na tsi yanjina, mfalume mmwenga andapigana na mfalume wanjina. Dunia indakala ichisumba kpwatu kunji na kundakala na ndzala. Mambo higa ni dza viratu mwandzo wa utsungu wa mayo alondaye kudzivugula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
