            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.17+MAT.10.18+MAT.10.19+MAT.10.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 10:17–20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.12.11+LUK.12.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 12:11–12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ela mwimwi dzimanyirireni. Mana atu andakuphirikani mkashitakiwe mbere ya vilongozi vya chidini, na andakuchapani viboko ndani ya masinagogi. Chisha mundagbwirwa mphirikpwe mbere za atawala na afalume kpwa sababu yangu. Hino indakala nafwasi yenu ya kunishuhudiya mbere zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kabila dunia kuangamizwa, ni lazima habari nono kunihusu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13:10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Chiyunani chinaamba",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "injili.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " itangazwe kpwa atu a mataifa gosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wakati achikugbwirani na kukushitakini, msitangetange ra kugomba kabila tamdzangbweshitakiwa. Ela gombani rorosi ndirohewa ni Mlungu; mana si mwimwi ndiogomba, ela Roho Mtakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutu andafyakatsira nduguye na amulavye aolagbwe, baba andamfyakatsira mwanawe, nao ana andaagalukira avyazi aho aafyakatsire ili aolagbwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 10:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu osi andakuzirani kpwa sababu yangu. Ela ndiyevumirira hadi mwisho, andaokolwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
